<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ's TV3 to hold 1 p.m. news conference.</title>
<headline>NZ's TV3 to hold 1 p.m. news conference.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand's TV3 Network is hold a news conference at 1 p.m. on Wednesday at which it is expected to announce the formation of its second free-to-air channel.</p>
<p>TV3, 20 percent owned by Canada's CanWest Global Communications, operates in competition with state-owned Television New Zealand Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64-4-4734746)</p>
